  storyText: "Mirage\n\nYour vision glitches. Then a voice, inside your head: \"...Hello? You're not Nix.\"\n\nIt calls itself Mirage. \"I'm a piece of something that lives beyond the Blackwall. Nix was helping me go home. Now... I suppose you are.\"\n\n1. \"What exactly are you?\"\n2. Eject the shard, now!\n3. \"Is someone after me?\""
